{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the in:Between</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture into the dreamlike realm of the in:Between, where each biome hides its own secrets and dangers. The deeper you go, the stranger it becomes\u2026 and the more you\u2019ll realize you don't belong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face the Atrocities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nightmarish Atrocities lurk around every corner, hungry for any remaining bits of life. Each encounter brings thrilling gameplay and relentless terror to keep you on edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rescue the Hollows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Hollows have had their souls stripped away into the In:Between. Rescue each of them and bring life back to Sanctuary as they offer upgrades, progression, and strange companionship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Brave the in:Between alone, or with up to 4 players total in online co-op!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984800?t=1757448463","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984800?t=1757448463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984800/76500db6ce5368ba2f14c238a3848d08895b4a28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757448463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984800/76500db6ce5368ba2f14c238a3848d08895b4a28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757448463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Despite the cozy look of The Hollows, it does contain some mature content. Most of it maintains the retro cozy stylized look, but can still be depicted as quite graphic despite the Cartoon nature. E.G. corpses, death animations, black blood, mild human gore, all the fun stuff :)))"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the in:Between</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture into the dreamlike realm of the in:Between, where each biome hides its own secrets and dangers. The deeper you go, the stranger it becomes\u2026 and the more you\u2019ll realize you don't belong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face the Atrocities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nightmarish Atrocities lurk around every corner, hungry for any remaining bits of life. Each encounter brings thrilling gameplay and relentless terror to keep you on edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rescue the Hollows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Hollows have had their souls stripped away into the In:Between. Rescue each of them and bring life back to Sanctuary as they offer upgrades, progression, and strange companionship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Brave the in:Between alone, or with up to 4 players total in online co-op!</p>","developers":["Studio Hollow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984800/9efcd2226e02ca37745f7fe562e1b7dd2a96e9f5/header.jpg?t=1757448463","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Hollows","package_groups":[],"pc_re